            "review_title": "Review at Peas Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Fernando R\nBuenos Aires, Argentina95 contributions\n0\nTasty, friendly and cheap\nDec 2019 • Solo\nI live on Da Nang, My An. This is one of the best choices around for its combination of Confortable seats, simple but nice decor, good prices and a daily promo (Mon-Fri one Menu item group for just 32000VDN). They cook fairy quick and serve a free ginger/lemon water.\nSo far, just the owner can speak English but they have English menu and the staff do its best to communicate, using Google translator if necessary.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 17, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
