            "review_title": "Review at Peas Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Reginald W\nDa Nang, Vietnam507 contributions\n0\nCozy and Delicious!\nOct 2019 • Couples\nEAT YOUR PEAS!\n\nWhen you come here, you’ll WANT to eat your peas!!!\n\nMy wife and I have eaten here FOUR times now (in one week) and each experience has been superb. The dishes are beautifully presented, the food is delightfully flavorful, fresh and delicious—and very reasonably priced!! And many of the dishes are very creative WITHOUT resorting to fake animal products. The decor is simple, but tasteful and relaxing, and the restaurant is air conditioned. Best of all, the staff are sweet, friendly and genuine. Their recommendations have been spot on. \n\nPlease note that for each day of the week they have one whole segment of the menu marked down to 32,000 VND (same price for each item regardless of original price).\n\nI expect we’ll be eating here very often for as long as we live in Danang. Highly recommended!!\nRead more\nWritten October 26, 2019",
